      "description": "Mittens was a domestic cat owned by Helen Keller and was a beloved companion. The cat's name and its association with Keller are real-world facts that provide context for the meme. The meme relies on the knowledge that Keller had a pet, which is then used to create the ironic contrast.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
