      "description": "Ableism is the discrimination or social prejudice against people with disabilities. While the meme does not directly attack Keller based on her disability, it may be perceived as ableist by trivializing her achievements and reducing her to a domestic context, which can be seen as diminishing the value of her accomplishments as a person with a disability.",
